00:18:45.250 --> 00:18:45.910
Oh!

00:18:47.130 --> 00:18:51.450
The 15th Future-Model Idol Audition Grand-prix is...

00:18:51.510 --> 00:18:52.290
Nogiza...

00:18:52.650 --> 00:18:54.240
Kyaaaaahh!!

00:18:53.500 --> 00:18:54.640
Wh-what!?

00:18:55.910 --> 00:18:57.910
Thank you for waiting~

00:18:58.500 --> 00:18:59.600
Nanami-san!

00:19:00.770 --> 00:19:02.640
Yuuto-sama, are you okay?

00:19:03.180 --> 00:19:04.170
Hazuki-san!

00:19:07.590 --> 00:19:09.560
Se-Senpai...

00:19:09.720 --> 00:19:11.560
Wh-what is this!?

00:19:11.890 --> 00:19:14.200
Do you really think you can get away with this!?

00:19:14.810 --> 00:19:15.730
It's fine.

00:19:15.970 --> 00:19:17.900
That's what Nogizaka is for.

00:19:19.610 --> 00:19:20.550
Y-you are...!

00:19:23.190 --> 00:19:25.720
From this event hall to the audition host, 

00:19:25.990 --> 00:19:29.890
every merchandise and CD you prepared for Haruka, 

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:36.090
and your office have been bought by my own Nogizaka Family!

00:19:36.400 --> 00:19:37.860
This is the end of you!

00:19:38.050 --> 00:19:39.600
Eeeeeehhhhh!?!?

00:19:40.250 --> 00:19:46.600
Tricking my Haruka with lies and using her for your self-interest is inexcusable!

00:19:46.800 --> 00:19:49.330
I hope you are prepared for your consequences!

00:19:50.350 --> 00:19:51.780
Yeeeeek!!

00:19:51.780 --> 00:19:54.150
Now now, Dad, calm down.

00:19:54.410 --> 00:19:58.080
It's true that it was wrong for them to trick Haruka, 

00:19:58.160 --> 00:20:04.660
but looking into it, it seems like they just sincerely wanted to have a wonderful idol make her debut, so...

00:20:04.990 --> 00:20:08.270
It means onee-chan has the talent to become an idol, 

00:20:08.390 --> 00:20:10.890
so isn't it something to be proud of as a dad?

00:20:11.400 --> 00:20:13.360
Why don't you forgive them for that?

00:20:13.760 --> 00:20:14.620
Hmm...

00:20:15.920 --> 00:20:17.390
Oh....

00:20:17.630 --> 00:20:18.680
Hah...

00:20:18.780 --> 00:20:19.470
Haruka...

00:20:21.010 --> 00:20:21.640
I...

00:20:22.610 --> 00:20:24.660
What you said earlier...

00:20:25.410 --> 00:20:26.470
makes me happy...

00:20:27.080 --> 00:20:29.020
I won't go anywhere.

00:20:29.720 --> 00:20:31.780
I'll always be by Yuuto-san's side.

00:20:32.490 --> 00:20:33.240
Haruka...

00:20:33.390 --> 00:20:35.130
Well, well.

00:20:33.710 --> 00:20:34.470
Ehe!

00:20:34.870 --> 00:20:35.950
Kyaahh!!

00:20:46.290 --> 00:20:47.740
No~~

00:20:47.800 --> 00:20:49.540
Ahhhn....

00:20:49.770 --> 00:20:52.190
Uhuhu, just as I thought, 

00:20:52.490 --> 00:20:57.470
those two are better at this than working as manager.

00:20:57.900 --> 00:20:59.810
Yeah, no doubt about it.

00:21:01.470 --> 00:21:07.090
You're new song is popular, Milan-chan, but I heard you're looking for a manager?

00:21:07.580 --> 00:21:15.420
Yes, qualifications are punctual, energetic, and someone who knows how to take the carbonation out of a coke.

00:21:17.150 --> 00:21:18.970
Um...this...

00:21:19.730 --> 00:21:21.520
It's a little late, but...

00:21:22.120 --> 00:21:23.760
it's a Valentine's Day chocolate...

00:21:24.360 --> 00:21:26.160
Th-thank you...

00:21:26.970 --> 00:21:27.700
what's this?

00:21:28.110 --> 00:21:28.820
Um...

00:21:29.220 --> 00:21:31.650
it's my original piano music CD...

00:21:32.090 --> 00:21:35.300
I wanted to give something more than a chocolate...

00:21:35.870 --> 00:21:40.330
And then, there was a recording practice at the lesson the other day, 

00:21:40.880 --> 00:21:44.830
so I asked Yayoi-san to make it.

00:21:45.250 --> 00:21:45.710
Uh...

00:21:46.280 --> 00:21:50.130
Wait, is the reason you decided to be in the audition...?

00:21:51.060 --> 00:21:53.480
...I played with Yuuto-san on my mind...

00:21:54.650 --> 00:21:57.140
...it would be great if you like it...

00:21:57.810 --> 00:21:58.320
Oh...

00:22:00.300 --> 00:22:01.030
Haruka!

00:22:00.870 --> 00:22:01.310
Yu...

00:22:01.500 --> 00:22:04.220
Yu-yu-yu-yu-Yuuto-san!

00:22:05.010 --> 00:22:05.740
Haruka...

00:22:06.560 --> 00:22:07.270
I...

00:22:07.290 --> 00:22:09.680
Oh..aw...oh..oh...

00:22:13.070 --> 00:22:13.760
Oh...

00:22:14.240 --> 00:22:14.960
Yuuto-sa...

00:22:15.490 --> 00:22:16.770
Kyaaah!!

00:22:16.870 --> 00:22:17.970
I knew it.

00:22:18.430 --> 00:22:19.760
Itata...

00:22:20.040 --> 00:22:23.350
O-onii-san you've become pretty shrewd.

00:22:23.590 --> 00:22:26.050
It's every single time, geez.

00:22:26.360 --> 00:22:27.390
Ehehe~

00:22:27.790 --> 00:22:31.840
but onii-san's got it good, hugging her like that.

00:22:32.070 --> 00:22:32.650
Ugh...

00:22:33.010 --> 00:22:35.920
Really, you've become much more daring.

00:22:36.190 --> 00:22:38.440
Daring...come here.

00:24:14.850 --> 00:24:19.020
(Nogizaka Vocabulary Fundamentals)

00:24:16.260 --> 00:24:18.120
Nogizaka Vocabulary Fundamentals!

00:24:18.240 --> 00:24:20.100
The last word is "purezza"!

00:24:19.020 --> 00:24:28.780
(Purezza)

00:24:20.230 --> 00:24:23.740
It's a music vocabulary, meaning pure in Italian.

00:24:23.740 --> 00:24:26.430
It's a perfect word for Haruka, huh?

00:24:26.430 --> 00:24:28.570
Oh no...Yuuto-san...

00:24:28.780 --> 00:24:34.780
(Next: "It's a Promise!")

00:24:28.800 --> 00:24:29.440
Haruka...

00:24:29.740 --> 00:24:30.500
Yuuto-san.

00:24:30.870 --> 00:24:31.720
Haruka.

00:24:31.890 --> 00:24:32.840
Yuuto-san!

00:24:33.120 --> 00:24:34.020
Haruka!

00:24:34.780 --> 00:24:39.780
(Nogizaka Haruka no Himitsu Purezza) 

00:24:34.780 --> 00:24:39.820
(See you next week!)
